{"type":"standard","title":"Pete Stauber","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pete Stauber</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q55955746","titles":{"canonical":"Pete_Stauber","normalized":"Pete Stauber","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pete Stauber</span></span>"},"pageid":58011945,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e1/Pete_Stauber_118th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpeg/330px-Pete_Stauber_118th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Pete_Stauber_118th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3155,"height":3944},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375577003","tid":"dfade89e-b383-11f1-b42a-06d05816e73d","timestamp":"2026-09-18T17:10:40Z","description":"American hockey player and politician (born 1966)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pete_Stauber","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pete_Stauber?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pete_Stauber?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Pete_Stauber"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pete_Stauber","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Pete_Stauber","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pete_Stauber?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Pete_Stauber"}},"extract":"Peter Allen Stauber is an American politician, former minor-league hockey player, and retired law enforcement officer from Minnesota serving as the United States representative for Minnesota's 8th congressional district. A member of the Republican Party, Stauber has represented the district since 2019.","extract_html":"<p><b>Peter Allen Stauber</b> is an American politician, former minor-league hockey player, and retired law enforcement officer from Minnesota serving as the United States representative for Minnesota's 8th congressional district. A member of the Republican Party, Stauber has represented the district since 2019.</p>"}